Original dataset license: CC BY-SA 4.0.
Modifications: selected entailment/contradiction triplets, trained MiniLM query/value
LoRA adapter, computed retrieval evaluation summaries and per-query ranks.

The upstream sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2 base encoder is separately
licensed Apache-2.0. This adapter requires that base; the base weights are not
redistributed in this directory. Preserve upstream notices when reconstructing it.

This directory's terms do not replace the root MIT license for application source.
